---
id: observe
title: "Observe before inferring"
---

:::mcf-activity
type: notes
id: observation-notes
:::

# Start with what the evidence shows

An **observation** records evidence before an inference explains it.

:::mcf-end

:::mcf-activity
type: practice
id: observation-practice
:::

```mcf-question
id: observation-choice
type: multiple_choice
prompt: "Which statement is a direct observation?"
options:
  - id: spots
    text: "The rock has three dark spots."
  - id: rain
    text: "Rain caused the spots."
answer: spots
```

:::mcf-end
